msgid "Connect with Dropbox…"
msgstr "Connetti con Dropbox…"

msgid ""
"Dropbox needs an app registered to you:\n"
"1. At dropbox.com/developers/apps, press Create app.\n"
"2. Choose Scoped access, then App folder or Full Dropbox.\n"
"3. Give it a name no one else has used and press Create app.\n"
"4. On Permissions, tick account_info.read, files.content.write and sharing."
"write, then press Submit.\n"
"5. On Settings, under OAuth 2, add the redirect URI {uri} and press Add.\n"
"6. Copy the App key into the field above.\n"
"Development status is enough. Leave the field empty to use this build's own "
"key, if it has one."
msgstr ""
"Dropbox richiede un'app registrata a tuo nome:\n"
"1. Su dropbox.com/developers/apps, premi Create app.\n"
"2. Scegli Scoped access, poi App folder o Full Dropbox.\n"
"3. Dalle un nome che nessun altro ha usato e premi Create app.\n"
"4. In Permissions, spunta account_info.read, files.content.write e sharing."
"write, poi premi Submit.\n"
